g trails and get the chance to handfeed wild birds. The iconic Robin's Roost Treehouse as well as two waterfront cabins offers an incredible camping experience you won’t find anywhere else. Discover a nature-first camping experience filled with wildlife, trails, and unique overnight stays. Spot migratory waterfowl, birds of prey, and seasonal species throughout the year. Quiet river views, appealing to guests who enjoy peaceful mornings and easy access to the shoreline","photo":"https://www.stlawrenceparks.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/11/dji_0024-2-scaled.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Riverside Cedar","price":1799,"per":"/group","optionIdx":2},{"label":"Crysler Park","price":2933,"per":"/group","optionIdx":3},{"label":"Glengarry","price":3029,"per":"/group","optionIdx":4},{"label":"Farran","price":3029,"per":"/group","optionIdx":5},{"label":"Brown's Bay","price":3566,"per":"/group","optionIdx":6},{"label":"McLaren","price":3965,"per":"/group","optionIdx":7},{"label":"Upper Canada Migratory Bird Sanctuary","price":3965,"per":"/group","optionIdx":8},{"label":"Ivy Lea","price":3965,"per":"/group","optionIdx":9}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[{"name":"Camping - Additional Vehicle","detail":"","price":13}],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"The Long Sault Parkway is a series of 11 islands that were created from high points of land left after the flooding of the St. Lawrence River during the construction of the Seaway in the 1950's.","cover":"https://www.stlawrenceparks.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/06/Woodlands_FamilyLodge-scaled.jpg","photos":["https://www.stlawrenceparks.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/06/Woodlands_FamilyLodge-scaled.jpg","https://www.stlawrenceparks.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/09/Parks_Woodlands_FamilyLodge_2025_00001-scaled.jpg","https://www.stlawrenceparks.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/09/Parks_Woodlands_FamilyLodge_2025_00003-scaled.jpg","https://www.stlawren